  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding Independent Media and Information Integrity in Ukraine: Emergency Response and Sustainable Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be implemented along the following three outcomes:

1.	The safety and resilience of journalists, media workers, and freedom-of-expression defenders are strengthened through emergency assistance, psychological support, with a strong gender-sensitive approach.
2.	The viability of Ukrainian media outlets is advanced through support for sustainable business models development and tailored audience outreach.
3.	Access to reliable information is reinforced through the promotion of international standards on freedom of expression, information integrity, and enhanced media and information literacy.</narrative>
  </description>
